<title>USA: Bucyrus International deal gets FTC nod.</title>
<headline>Bucyrus International deal gets FTC nod.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bucyrus International Inc said Wednesday the Federal Trade Commission has granted early termination of the waiting period under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act.</p>
<p>This will allow Bucyrus to complete its previously announced acquisition of the assets of the Marion Power Shovel Co and the assets of the certain related businesses from Global Industrial Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed within 15 days, Bucyrus said in a news release.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
